name verbatlas-preference-info
# A selectional preference on each row: its id (va:0001p, a key, recorded nowhere), its reference BabelNet synset
# (read as the ILI concept), its name, and a picture of it (a fourth column the file does not name: a pair).
match VA_preference_info.tsv
grammar table
comment V
columns ID reference_BabelNet_synset_ID name fourth
key ID
type reference_BabelNet_synset_ID ili
claims
subject in name
attest reference_BabelNet_synset_ID
claims
pair
subject in name
object in fourth
